WEBVTT

00:16.385 --> 00:19.285
If my eyes are blinded by the sun

00:19.285 --> 00:23.965
I may just see the limits of the light.

00:23.965 --> 00:25.865
The mind of stardust

00:25.865 --> 00:31.705
What a small universe I live in

00:31.705 --> 00:39.245
Won't somebody give me
a code that starts at zero?

00:39.245 --> 00:41.815
Multiplied and in confusion

00:41.815 --> 00:45.845
A colony dead inside its cage

00:45.845 --> 00:50.325
Shoot your cowardly dreams

00:50.325 --> 00:53.495
Loneliness... self-destruct!

00:53.495 --> 00:57.895
No matter what sacrifices we make

00:57.895 --> 01:01.735
for a future just beyond reach

01:01.735 --> 01:05.405
Let our hearts speak to each other

01:05.405 --> 01:08.705
deep down inside

01:08.705 --> 01:12.845
Though the days just one step behind

01:12.845 --> 01:15.845
will pass even farther from us

01:15.845 --> 01:22.915
You will be in my thoughts

01:42.235 --> 01:44.765
There are two kinds of companions.

01:45.705 --> 01:48.445
Companions who are
bound by ties of friendship...

01:48.445 --> 01:53.285
and companions who waste all their energy
arguing nonstop even though it's really hot...

01:53.285 --> 01:56.985
How many times do you
want me to repeat the same thing?!

01:56.985 --> 02:00.255
This is a human town,
so there's nothing else we can do!

02:00.255 --> 02:02.325
I don't care what you say...
the answer's no, bear-o!

02:02.325 --> 02:07.465
Now listen... you think this is fun for me?!
Walking around with a stuffed animal at my age!

02:07.465 --> 02:11.165
Well me either... I can't just
pretend to be some stuffed animal, bear-o!

02:11.165 --> 02:14.105
So... you think you can maybe pull
off posing as a human baby, then?

02:14.105 --> 02:15.905
B-B-B-Bear-o!

02:15.905 --> 02:17.945
Oh, the wittle bear's angwy...

02:17.945 --> 02:18.905
Of course I'm angry!

02:18.905 --> 02:21.965
- What do you expect?!
- Lt's so hot and muggy...

02:22.975 --> 02:25.845
Will the three of you be needing a room?

02:28.985 --> 02:31.785
Yeah, if it's all right, that's what we'd like.

02:31.785 --> 02:33.525
But, um...

02:33.525 --> 02:35.095
Oh, I don't care about that.

02:35.095 --> 02:38.365
You can't stay in business being
choosy about your customers, now can you?

02:38.365 --> 02:40.935
You really mean it? Oh, I'm so glad!

02:40.935 --> 02:42.165
Bear-o...

02:42.165 --> 02:46.105
It's just... I'm sorry to ask this, but,
do you have the money for the room?

02:46.105 --> 02:47.035
Yes!

02:47.035 --> 02:50.805
Oh, that's good!
You three seem to be decent travelers.

02:50.805 --> 02:52.975
Huh? What do you mean by that?

02:52.975 --> 02:56.785
Well, what I mean is that
World Destruction Committee's

02:56.785 --> 02:59.045
been raising hell around
this whole area lately!

02:59.045 --> 02:59.955
Wha...?!

02:59.955 --> 03:01.455
That's, uh...

03:01.455 --> 03:06.155
They must be hard up for cash, because they
keep robbing people and eating without paying.

03:06.155 --> 03:10.195
Is... that... so?

03:10.195 --> 03:15.095
"There are Two Kinds of Companions"

03:24.205 --> 03:26.475
Um, excuse me...

03:26.475 --> 03:28.805
I hate to ask you about the bill, but...

03:31.385 --> 03:34.315
This world was created by the gods.

03:34.315 --> 03:39.025
So I wonder... why did the gods go out of their
way to create both beastmen and humans?

03:39.025 --> 03:40.695
Huh?!

03:40.695 --> 03:44.165
It wasn't out of revenge for
being dumped by goddesses...

03:44.165 --> 03:46.835
and it certainly wasn't
because their fingers slipped

03:46.835 --> 03:50.205
on account of being distracted by demons.

03:50.205 --> 03:52.505
This is a sublime message...

03:52.505 --> 03:53.335
"Hark!"

03:53.335 --> 03:57.845
"Let us transcend our differences and foster
love between tribes!"...is what it means.

03:57.845 --> 03:58.875
Love!

03:58.875 --> 04:01.345
That rather vague and
extremely hard-to-understand thing...

04:01.345 --> 04:04.435
They simply showed us an example of what it is!

04:05.685 --> 04:07.715
And when I say transcending
differences between "tribes"...

04:07.715 --> 04:11.185
of course that also applies to the
differences between men and women.

04:11.185 --> 04:13.525
Speaking of which...

04:13.525 --> 04:17.425
I've been trying my darnedest to seduce
you for the last several minutes now...

04:17.425 --> 04:20.695
or haven't you noticed?

04:20.695 --> 04:21.855
Eh?!

04:22.765 --> 04:25.465
Maybe all you need is some physical contact!

04:29.775 --> 04:31.545
Ow-wow-wow-wow-wow...

04:31.545 --> 04:34.715
Can't you express your jealousy
in a somewhat gentler manner?!

04:34.715 --> 04:36.045
Who said anything about jealousy?

04:36.045 --> 04:37.285
We're leaving.

04:37.285 --> 04:40.305
P-Please, you guys. Don't start fighting!

04:41.915 --> 04:44.485
But um... the bill?

04:44.485 --> 04:47.555
You'll probably be startled to hear this...

04:47.555 --> 04:50.825
but I'm Kyrie of the
World Destruction Committee!

04:52.665 --> 04:54.565
Likewise, I'm Morte.

04:54.565 --> 04:57.895
And I'm, um... Toppy.

04:59.805 --> 05:02.305
Ha-ha! I love that scream!

05:02.305 --> 05:04.775
If any of you decide to go
and inform the town authorities...

05:04.775 --> 05:08.115
I'll make sure we hear plenty
more of those screams from you.

05:08.115 --> 05:10.185
So don't say you weren't warned.

05:10.185 --> 05:12.235
Ciao!

05:14.855 --> 05:17.755
Ow!

05:17.755 --> 05:19.985
I'm s... I'm sorry!

05:29.695 --> 05:32.365
Sorry 'bout that. Are you okay?

05:32.365 --> 05:33.335
Huh?

05:33.335 --> 05:34.705
We're going.

05:34.705 --> 05:35.935
Okay.

05:36.845 --> 05:38.945
How much longer will it be...

05:38.945 --> 05:41.375
before we reach the new world?

05:52.825 --> 05:54.845
Bear-o!

05:56.395 --> 05:59.725
After we rest here awhile,
we start by asking around, bear-o!

05:59.725 --> 06:01.565
Just let it go, already.

06:01.565 --> 06:03.065
So what if we have imposters...

06:03.065 --> 06:05.205
they'll just draw the attention
of the World Salvation Committee...

06:05.205 --> 06:06.405
and that's good for us, right?

06:06.405 --> 06:08.235
I can't do that, bear-o!

06:08.235 --> 06:12.645
I can't just sit quiet while my name as a
hero is being dragged through the mud, bear-o!

06:12.645 --> 06:16.145
Well, I get the feeling you're a little late.

06:16.145 --> 06:19.385
You stand out like a sore thumb
in this town anyway, Toppy...

06:19.385 --> 06:23.385
and we've already pressed our luck by asking
them to bring in a special bed just for you.

06:23.385 --> 06:26.185
Let's just go to bed early tonight, okay?

06:26.185 --> 06:29.395
So then... you cover for your friend
by saying you stole all that money...

06:29.395 --> 06:31.525
but eating without paying goes too far?

06:31.525 --> 06:32.925
All right, fine, bear-o!

06:32.925 --> 06:34.835
I'll just go do it myself, bear-o!

06:34.835 --> 06:36.565
Whoa!

06:36.565 --> 06:38.335
C'mon, Toppy!

06:38.335 --> 06:39.765
Toppy!

06:39.765 --> 06:41.065
Top...!

06:43.875 --> 06:46.105
Hey, get off...

06:46.105 --> 06:48.105
Oh... sorry.

06:52.615 --> 06:53.945
Yikes!

06:56.115 --> 06:57.925
What's your problem?

06:57.925 --> 06:59.785
Nothing...

07:00.625 --> 07:02.255
She's gonna hit me!

07:02.255 --> 07:03.595
But if I just tell her the truth...

07:03.595 --> 07:05.565
No, she's gonna kill me!

07:05.565 --> 07:06.425
Huh?

07:08.565 --> 07:11.105
If you want information on those guys...

07:11.105 --> 07:15.235
then I'm gonna have to ask you to order at
least as much as they ate without paying for.

07:15.235 --> 07:19.105
After all, if you World Salvation Committee
guys were more on the ball about this stuff...

07:19.105 --> 07:20.945
You'd better watch what you say!

07:20.945 --> 07:24.315
Human scum... you really think
you're in a position to bargain with me?!

07:24.315 --> 07:25.645
No, I just, uh!

07:25.645 --> 07:28.715
Lia... How many times do I
have to tell you not to rely on force?

07:28.715 --> 07:31.125
I've had it up to here with your stupid logic!

07:31.125 --> 07:35.455
Have any of your calculations
ever worked out for us... even once?!

07:35.455 --> 07:37.965
My calculations are perfect.

07:37.965 --> 07:41.565
Up to now we've just been lacking
a little in the area of luck, that's all.

07:41.565 --> 07:44.635
But what's the big deal, anyway?

07:44.635 --> 07:47.105
This way we get to have
ourselves a little snack.

07:48.805 --> 07:51.905
All right! Bring 'em every item
those guys ate without paying for!

07:51.905 --> 07:53.005
So then?

07:53.005 --> 07:56.775
Lately I've been hearing they showed
up at an antique shop in the next town over.

07:56.775 --> 07:57.785
The next town over?

07:57.785 --> 08:00.615
Yeah, it's a beastman town.

08:01.615 --> 08:04.755
It's just at the top of
that mountain over there.

08:04.755 --> 08:08.355
Look, you can see it from here.

08:08.355 --> 08:10.795
We're supposed to walk all the way up there?!

08:10.795 --> 08:12.355
Here you go!

08:21.175 --> 08:23.845
Well, I reckon beastmen do
come in all shapes 'n' sizes...

08:23.845 --> 08:29.015
but I been a sheriff fer many a year now,
and I ain't never seen no beastman like you.

08:29.015 --> 08:33.015
I thank you for your long years of
service working day and night, bear-o.

08:33.015 --> 08:37.125
So then, about the current activities
of the World Destruction Committee...

08:37.125 --> 08:40.725
Well, it's pretty much just robbin'
folks an' eatin' without payin' and such.

08:40.725 --> 08:44.725
Even been someone got hurt pretty
bad when them robbers busted in on 'im.

08:44.725 --> 08:46.625
I can't stand bandits like that, bear-o!

08:46.625 --> 08:51.965
I'd say most every antique shop an'
rest'rant in the area's been hit by 'em.

08:51.965 --> 08:56.005
Why, I even hear a rest'rant right
near here got knocked over just a bit ago.

08:56.005 --> 08:57.475
Just a bit ago?!

08:57.475 --> 08:58.175
Yep.

08:58.175 --> 09:00.345
That's why I'm callin' up
witnesses right now and...

09:00.345 --> 09:04.015
Wow! This time it's an litty bitty bear!

09:04.015 --> 09:05.685
- Yay!
- B-Bear-o!

09:05.685 --> 09:08.555
- Lt's a bear! It's a bear!
- Just a! Put me down!

09:08.555 --> 09:11.025
Don't call me a bear, bear-o!

09:11.025 --> 09:12.555
He talked!

09:12.555 --> 09:14.925
The bear talked, sheriff!

09:14.925 --> 09:17.025
Maya, cut that out!

09:17.025 --> 09:20.195
Can't you see that little bear don't like it?

09:20.195 --> 09:25.335
So Maya, could you tell us about
what happened at the rest'rant earlier?

09:25.335 --> 09:29.905
Sure! What happened was a bear that's a
much bigger and badder bear than this one...

09:29.905 --> 09:31.545
he said he was sorry to me!

09:31.545 --> 09:33.675
Whoa... he said sorry?

09:33.675 --> 09:37.345
Yeah! He's a much scarier
bear than this bear here...

09:37.345 --> 09:40.285
but he said sorry, and he said it to me!

09:40.285 --> 09:42.415
I'm not a bear, bear-o!

09:48.695 --> 09:53.025
Wow... this is a pretty good painting, huh?

09:53.025 --> 09:54.765
That's... right...

09:54.765 --> 09:58.465
You should...
just keep looking... right at it...

10:01.875 --> 10:02.875
What's with you?

10:02.875 --> 10:07.715
He-he-heh... pretty hot in here...

10:07.715 --> 10:08.805
Is that a...?

10:11.245 --> 10:13.315
Hey, Morte!

10:13.315 --> 10:14.785
Lookee over here!

10:14.785 --> 10:16.955
What do you say we go?

10:16.955 --> 10:18.115
Go where?

10:20.795 --> 10:22.725
Over there... the one with the chimney!

10:22.725 --> 10:25.255
It's gotta be a bathhouse!

10:29.635 --> 10:32.655
Let's hurry and go
together and warm up right now!

10:33.805 --> 10:35.005
Go "together"?

10:35.005 --> 10:37.495
Uh... th-that's not what I...

10:39.575 --> 10:40.915
And then?

10:40.915 --> 10:43.645
It was a horrific scene.

10:43.645 --> 10:46.785
The shop owner put up a fight
and sustained some serious injuries.

10:46.785 --> 10:49.355
See here?

10:49.355 --> 10:54.525
It's all because you World Salvation Committee
guys aren't on the ball about this stuff...

10:54.525 --> 10:56.825
You watch your mou...

10:57.995 --> 10:59.965
Are you two all right over there?

10:59.965 --> 11:02.595
As long as you can provide
us with correct information...

11:02.595 --> 11:04.765
we'll show you how quickly
we can apprehend these miscreants.

11:04.765 --> 11:08.775
So then... where are the...
World Destruction... Committee members?

11:08.775 --> 11:13.815
Well, the latest word on the street is that they
made an appearance at the next town over.

11:13.815 --> 11:16.315
The next... town... over?

11:16.315 --> 11:17.115
That's right.

11:17.115 --> 11:21.655
From here you just cross two
mountain peaks and it's right there.

11:21.655 --> 11:24.515
Well, you can't see it from here!

12:01.395 --> 12:06.025
So they've been burglarizing places but then
running out on the bill in cheap restaurants...

12:06.025 --> 12:08.865
Their actions don't seem
coordinated at all, bear-o.

12:08.865 --> 12:12.765
And based on the testimony of
a little girl who saw them in person...

12:14.775 --> 12:16.835
Are you guys even listening, bear-o?!

12:16.835 --> 12:17.745
Huh?

12:17.745 --> 12:20.345
Uh... so everything'll be fine, right?

12:20.345 --> 12:23.885
C'mon, you guys! Try taking this
a little bit more seriously, bear-o!

12:23.885 --> 12:28.115
How do you think I felt
doing this investigation, bear-o?!

12:28.115 --> 12:30.055
I'm going to get some water.

12:30.055 --> 12:32.585
This isn't exactly the
biggest of our worries, Toppy!

12:32.585 --> 12:33.755
Bear-o?

12:33.755 --> 12:35.725
Look over there!

12:35.725 --> 12:36.925
- Look at what, bear-o?
- I'd like some water, please?

12:36.925 --> 12:39.625
- Lt's just right there, Toppy!
- No problem. Wait here just a moment.

12:39.625 --> 12:42.095
Look... there!

12:42.095 --> 12:43.435
Bear-o!

12:43.435 --> 12:46.405
Why's this terrible thing
happening to us, bear-o?!

12:46.405 --> 12:48.205
Well, it's your fault, Toppy.

12:48.205 --> 12:50.205
What makes it my fault, bear-o?!

12:50.205 --> 12:51.975
Because you pushed me down that time and...

12:51.975 --> 12:53.245
What's going on?

12:53.245 --> 12:54.735
Bear-o!

12:59.485 --> 13:01.075
What's with you guys?

13:07.085 --> 13:08.755
What can I do for you?

13:08.755 --> 13:10.425
This is a superb inn.

13:10.425 --> 13:11.895
I'd like you to prepare a room for us.

13:11.895 --> 13:17.605
Of course, and uh... it's rude of me to ask
this, but do you have the money to pay for it?

13:17.605 --> 13:20.895
It seems the path to the
new world is long and steep.

13:24.505 --> 13:26.345
You'll probably be startled to hear this...

13:26.345 --> 13:29.275
but the World Destruction Committee is...

13:29.275 --> 13:32.905
Sorry to interrupt, sonny...
I got some questions fer ya.

13:37.255 --> 13:39.255
Th-The World... Destruction Committee is...

13:39.255 --> 13:43.285
is here... and we're just innocent
citizens about to be terrorized! Please help us!

13:46.025 --> 13:50.465
Look! They're the ones stirring up trouble...
the World Destruction Committee!

13:50.465 --> 13:52.435
What's that you say?!

13:53.305 --> 13:54.435
Uh...

13:54.435 --> 13:56.605
You're the one from before!

13:56.605 --> 13:59.275
Well... I thought
somethin' was fishy 'bout that!

13:59.275 --> 14:03.345
Ain't never been no beastman
as ridiculously puny as that one there.

14:03.345 --> 14:06.185
Ridiculously... puny?!

14:06.185 --> 14:09.155
Alright! Fess up an' tell me who you are!

14:09.155 --> 14:12.155
You think you can yank this ol'
sheriff's chain and get away with it?!

14:12.155 --> 14:13.885
Now wait just a minute, bear-o!

14:13.885 --> 14:18.965
Didn't you hear that little girl say she saw
some bear beastman other than me, bear-o?!

14:18.965 --> 14:23.365
Sure! What happened was a bear that's a
much bigger and badder bear than this one...

14:23.365 --> 14:25.705
he said he was sorry to me!

14:25.705 --> 14:27.705
Hm... you got a point.

14:27.705 --> 14:29.675
So you remember now, bear-o?

14:29.675 --> 14:31.875
"A much bigger and badder bear"...

14:31.875 --> 14:33.305
Huh?

14:33.305 --> 14:34.975
Time out!

14:34.975 --> 14:36.475
You, sir, serve the cause of justice!

14:36.475 --> 14:38.685
Don't be deceived by the words of a scoundrel!

14:38.685 --> 14:41.245
Look! Look at this bump!

14:46.585 --> 14:49.855
I was assaulted by this growth-stunted,
puppet-like excuse for a beastman!

14:49.855 --> 14:52.165
Completely out of the blue! And without warning!

14:52.165 --> 14:53.665
"Growth-stunted"?!

14:53.665 --> 14:55.365
Yeah, that one hurt, didn't it?

14:55.365 --> 14:57.665
Stop spouting all these half-baked lies, bear-o!

15:00.605 --> 15:03.675
Alright! Both of you keep yer distance!

15:03.675 --> 15:07.545
Line up over there...
I'm interrogatin' both groups!

15:20.185 --> 15:23.855
By my information, the World
Destruction Committee's a threesome

15:23.855 --> 15:27.225
with a human man an'
woman plus one beastman.

15:27.225 --> 15:29.465
The first one's a scrawny boy.

15:29.465 --> 15:30.705
"Scrawny"...

15:30.705 --> 15:33.635
That word hasn't applied
to me since the time I was born.

15:36.705 --> 15:40.075
The next one's a beautiful girl.

15:49.285 --> 15:52.925
An' the last one's a vicious-lookin' beastman!

15:52.925 --> 15:54.825
Bear-o...

15:54.825 --> 15:57.655
Vicious-lookin'?

16:00.095 --> 16:02.395
B-But I'm not like that!

16:06.965 --> 16:14.105
Accordin' to witnesses, the suspects fought at
the rest'rant where they ate without payin'...

16:15.745 --> 16:18.585
There's nothing the three of
us hate worse than fighting!

16:18.585 --> 16:21.145
After all, conflict gets
us nowhere! Isn't that right?

16:25.955 --> 16:26.975
Hey...!

16:31.765 --> 16:32.985
Bear-o!

16:43.375 --> 16:44.505
What?

16:44.505 --> 16:46.475
I've got no choice!

16:46.475 --> 16:47.805
What're you?!

16:51.345 --> 16:53.445
- Oh crap!
- Put me!

16:55.315 --> 16:58.285
Good grief. Lessee what's next...

16:58.285 --> 16:59.955
Durin' the fight,

16:59.955 --> 17:05.065
the woman threw the man across the room
with a strength that weren't too woman-like...

17:05.065 --> 17:09.395
Sounds to me like she's got
one heckuva violent disposition.

17:13.035 --> 17:17.475
Ah, what rare and ladylike grace.
A far cry from a violent disposition...

17:17.475 --> 17:18.705
right?

17:21.575 --> 17:23.845
All right, I get it.

17:26.315 --> 17:27.755
N-Not so much!

17:27.755 --> 17:30.655
Th-That's far enough!

17:35.155 --> 17:36.885
...crap!

17:47.535 --> 17:49.665
You knew about this?

17:50.905 --> 17:54.275
You knew about this, didn't you?

17:54.275 --> 17:56.215
G-Grace... f-fully...

17:58.215 --> 18:00.875
You know full well I can't do that!

18:02.915 --> 18:05.615
Seems we got us our answer.

18:08.925 --> 18:13.195
The evil have fallen,
so we'll just be on our way...

18:13.195 --> 18:14.785
Halt, bear-o!

18:19.765 --> 18:22.105
I'm sorry.

18:22.105 --> 18:26.305
But we just can't let
ourselves be captured right now.

18:26.305 --> 18:32.905
Not until we find the new world, the place where
humans and beastmen can live together in peace.

18:34.145 --> 18:36.055
We're going.

18:36.055 --> 18:39.425
Really... I'm sorry.

18:39.425 --> 18:41.095
Stop right there!

18:41.095 --> 18:42.955
What is it now?

18:42.955 --> 18:45.265
What's all this?!

18:45.265 --> 18:46.625
If I ain't mistaken,

18:46.625 --> 18:49.465
all these paintin's were stolen from
the antique shop in the next town over!

18:52.665 --> 18:54.005
This too!

18:54.005 --> 18:55.775
And these ones too!

18:55.775 --> 18:58.635
Pretty much ev'rythin' here!

19:06.185 --> 19:08.145
A beastman!

19:13.355 --> 19:15.995
A human man an' woman plus one beastman!

19:15.995 --> 19:18.355
It was you!

19:19.265 --> 19:21.195
Now don't get the wrong idea...

19:21.195 --> 19:23.495
We were only interested in things of value.

19:23.495 --> 19:26.505
We never did any rinky-dink stuff
like eating without paying the bill.

19:26.505 --> 19:31.945
I'm pretty sure all that was the work of that
bunch... the ones who were just trying to leave.

19:31.945 --> 19:33.475
None of that matters now.

19:33.475 --> 19:38.945
Now that they know about us, we can't
let them live to tell the tale, now can we?

19:38.945 --> 19:40.115
Morte!

19:40.115 --> 19:43.385
Hey... where do you think you're touching?!

19:45.885 --> 19:48.785
- I'm scared!
- Let go of me!

19:51.025 --> 19:52.555
Honey!

20:01.475 --> 20:05.165
We wasted so much time looking around!

20:05.905 --> 20:08.815
What the hell's going on here?!

20:08.815 --> 20:10.905
Who do you think you are?!

20:17.555 --> 20:19.485
Oh no, what do we do?

20:19.485 --> 20:21.855
What are you doing? We're getting out of here.

20:21.855 --> 20:23.825
I-I s-seem to have lost my n-nerve...

20:23.825 --> 20:25.225
I-I c-can't seem to m-move...

20:25.225 --> 20:26.365
I swear...

20:26.365 --> 20:27.995
Hey, you guys!

20:27.995 --> 20:29.665
This way, bear-o!

20:29.665 --> 20:31.065
Huh?

20:31.065 --> 20:32.765
Hurry up, bear-o!

20:39.045 --> 20:41.615
Can't you carry me just
a little more daintily?!

20:41.615 --> 20:43.845
Don't sweat it! Let's just hurry!

20:54.055 --> 20:57.715
It looks like we somehow
managed to get away, but...

21:01.595 --> 21:03.795
I'm so sorry!

21:03.795 --> 21:05.105
I'm sorry too.

21:05.105 --> 21:06.765
Sorry.

21:08.205 --> 21:10.635
You'll need to make good on every
time you ate without paying the bill...

21:10.635 --> 21:13.975
and you'll need to take over
the management of that inn, bear-o.

21:13.975 --> 21:16.545
Those are my conditions
for letting this slide, bear-o!

21:16.545 --> 21:18.945
Um... paying our
restaurant bills is one thing...

21:18.945 --> 21:22.215
but about us taking over the inn?

21:22.215 --> 21:26.825
Create a place where humans and
beastmen alike can spend their time, bear-o.

21:26.825 --> 21:28.895
The new world isn't something you seek out...

21:28.895 --> 21:31.565
it's something you
make for yourself, bear-o.

21:31.565 --> 21:33.125
Thank you so much!

21:33.125 --> 21:37.135
"Not something you seek out,
but something you make for yourself"...

21:37.135 --> 21:39.505
Never thought I'd ever hear a
good phrase I didn't think of first.

21:39.505 --> 21:42.775
All right, then. We have to get going now.

21:42.775 --> 21:44.965
You've given us more than you know.

21:46.805 --> 21:50.015
How about I leave you two with
a small piece of advice of my own?

21:50.015 --> 21:52.585
Here it is... never anger a woman.

21:52.585 --> 21:54.915
Nothing good can come of it.

21:54.915 --> 21:57.985
By the time you apologize,
it's generally too late anyway.

21:57.985 --> 21:59.525
Eh?

21:59.525 --> 22:01.625
So long... and good luck.

22:01.625 --> 22:03.425
We're outta here!

22:16.035 --> 22:19.005
Bear-o!

22:21.005 --> 22:24.515
The glimmering seas of sand

22:24.515 --> 22:27.645
The end of the green earth

22:27.645 --> 22:33.725
Memories overflowing from the sky

22:33.725 --> 22:36.855
now plunged into darkness

22:36.855 --> 22:40.065
The memories will pile up

22:40.065 --> 22:46.065
like mounds of rubble

22:46.065 --> 22:49.305
Mutual encounters

22:49.305 --> 22:52.375
Misunderstood feelings

22:52.375 --> 22:55.515
Interwoven words

22:55.515 --> 22:58.645
People hurting each other

22:58.645 --> 23:10.755
Does the path we walk on
still lead us to tomorrow?

23:13.595 --> 23:17.435
Living this moment against the world

23:17.435 --> 23:20.435
isn't just about changing the world

23:20.435 --> 23:26.005
We're off on a distant journey across the waves

23:26.005 --> 23:29.575
So let our living heartbeat echo in the wind

23:29.575 --> 23:33.115
Around the world, to the end of the world

23:33.115 --> 23:39.085
Until we reach

23:39.085 --> 23:50.695
the promised land just beyond

23:51.965 --> 23:52.765
What's that?!

23:52.765 --> 23:54.575
It's a sand whale, bear-o!

23:54.575 --> 23:55.935
Bear-o!

23:55.935 --> 23:58.045
The three of us find ourselves
tossed out on the Sand Sea...

23:58.045 --> 23:59.805
and once again we're picked up by Agan.

23:59.805 --> 24:00.405
What's that?!

24:00.405 --> 24:02.115
It's a subarenine, bear-o!

24:02.115 --> 24:03.445
Bear-o!

24:03.445 --> 24:05.585
Carrying the four of us and
all of Agan's cargo on board...

24:05.585 --> 24:07.915
the subarenine dives deep under the Sand Sea.

24:07.915 --> 24:10.885
Now that we've been captured,
what fate is in store for us?!

24:10.885 --> 24:13.785
Next time on World Destruction...

24:13.785 --> 24:15.595
Episode 8: "There Are Two Kinds of Smugglers."

24:15.595 --> 24:17.495
You guys hear a weird sound
coming from the cargo boxes?

24:17.495 --> 24:19.725
It's like some kind of ticking...

24:19.725 --> 24:20.715
bear-o?
